      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    face_value = 1000\n    coupon_rate = 0.05\n    market_yield = 0.07\n    years = 15\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    annual_coupon = face_value * coupon_rate\n    bond_price = sum(\n        annual_coupon / ((1 + market_yield) ** year)\n        for year in range(1, years + 1)\n    )\n    bond_price += face_value / ((1 + market_yield) ** years)\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to two decimal places\n    return round(bond_price, 2)\n```",
